proc - the /proc filesystem

SYNOPSIS
    /proc

DESCRIPTION
    Not on the disk and never was. These are questions about the running
    machine, and the answers are in the kernel, so writing them down anywhere
    would only make them stale.

      /proc/meminfo    memory, in kilobytes
      /proc/uptime     seconds since boot
      /proc/mounts     the mount table, which `mount` prints
      /proc/cpuinfo    how many processors, and what each has done
      /proc/version    which system this is
      /proc/<pid>/status   one process, by number

    A process's directory exists exactly as long as the process does.

SEE ALSO
    ps, mount, uptime
